PQL.Assert
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The generated DAX calls functions from PQL.Assert
(https://github.com/clientfirsttech/PQL.Assert, published on DAX Lib),
Copyright (c) 2026 Client First Technologies, licensed under the MIT License.
pql-odcs records only PQL.Assert function names and argument order, as data,
in pql_odcs/catalog/. It does not bundle PQL.Assert's functions.tmdl. If a
future release bundles it, that release must include PQL.Assert's copyright
and permission notice here.

